{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港姐冠軍黃嘉雯早前與一班師姐遠赴湖南進行外景拍攝。雖然行程緊湊，但她依然抓緊拍攝空檔向粉絲大派福利，在社交平台上載了一輯唯美的雨中個人靚相。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從相中可見，拍攝現場煙雨濛濛，極具詩意。黃嘉雯身穿一條藍白花紋的低胸吊帶長裙，將保養得宜的身形表露無遺。這身打扮不僅展現出她的完美鎖骨線條，一個轉身更激罕大騷美背，靚人配合靚景，可謂仙氣爆燈。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20261RpxvhV9Gw1785052215.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d-7.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026zQSizoJpyq1785052215.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d-7.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d-4.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026tlVqfUws2q1785052215.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️ You don’t have to d-4.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了賞心悅目的靚相外，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">黃嘉雯更附上了一段極具哲理的英文感性留言：「You can just let it sit with you — like a quiet rain outside your window. ☔️You don’t have to dance in it, or drown in it. Just let it fall. 🌧️」表達出她在雨中隨遇而安、優雅自在的心境。黃嘉雯更在帖文中「大爆」這輯「女神級」靚相的幕後功臣，原來正是同行的陳懿德。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T01:20:00.399282+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}